{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1000_043nor", "source_sha256": "4a85b49abb51ee54d00a0c45d27429f23ac589fa23990ccfa7c1fa007855cbba", "ja": "おっはよう、{$P$}！\n今朝は天気がよくて、気分がいいねっ。", "zh": "早安，{$P$}！\n今早天气很好，感觉很舒服呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1001_p", "source_sha256": "517eca0c10d24ae045b2c4dea98523f3e2886c213b0b8b96a3a3beb08c416928", "ja": "おはよう、のり子。\n朝から元気だな！", "zh": "早安，法子。\n你从一大早就很有活力嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "e274705aac58c817165f335bb5ce5d9b87a416f9a0b415fc24026b7f03378fbb", "ja": "えへへ、まあね！\n今日は劇場まで、バイクで来ちゃったよ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，对啊！\n我今天是骑机车来剧场的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6dca5753cc6eb184565f48001da754517b96370b67f7fe1ed240fb216a01af9e", "ja": "バイク……そうか、\nのり子はバイクが好きなんだったな。", "zh": "机车……对耶，\n法子喜欢骑机车。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "24e5aabba3717ab489c719a48018bcde07b597e1417d12c530437ebe7d6258f3", "ja": "うん！　だからこの前のレースクイーンの仕事とか、\nめちゃくちゃ楽しかったよ！", "zh": "嗯！所以像之前赛车女郎的工作，\n真的让我好开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "90bc4d4336c52d0302b93db641cc75857b850c2b8abe015d439d80e632107391", "ja": "アタシは、レースを見てるだけだったけど……\nでもあの場所にいるだけで、サイコーの気分だった！", "zh": "虽然我只是在一旁看比赛……\n但光是待在那里，感觉就超棒的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "f97ad8cddffe1f6e56d2e48b51902ec30feca9beed1588202d3c37f361173511", "ja": "バイクとは違う風を感じられて、気持ちよかったよ！\n普段はホラ、安全運転第一だしさっ。", "zh": "可以感受到跟骑机车时完全不同的感觉，非常舒服！\n毕竟平时是以安全驾驶为优先嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a4a9df73d7992a756e14b6d8f9f57c8389336080b67930e1ab276e120dc1104b", "ja": "はは、確かにそうだな。\nけどバイクって、そんなに気持ちがいいものなんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，的确如此。\n不过，原来骑机车是那么舒服的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "95837ddcaab53ff0d2483bb8eac15d12b08811e51a27802d942de28608959b0d", "ja": "もちろん！　{$P$}も、\nアタシのバイクの後ろに乗ってみる？", "zh": "那当然！{$P$}要不要\n坐坐看我的机车后座？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1009_p", "source_sha256": "05d88d040ca8fc95627aeddc49515bebc5df9125685a425cdb0857c8e95ef8e4", "ja": "へえ、乗せてくれるのか？\nじゃあ今度、試しに乗せてもらおうかな。", "zh": "哦，你要载我一程吗？\n那下次我再跟你借机车来骑骑看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "001d1fe146c8bae0e13046606ac38f7c802c81f438f0e305e3b903ef268bf605", "ja": "オッケー！　じゃあさっそく後ろに……ん？\nち、ちょっと待って！？", "zh": "OK！那就赶快坐上后座……嗯？\n等、等等喔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "c56abb8f6c0aeb15b3e05b2ea1da79b9a15aa3cdae3d6517b46f458c59dde825", "ja": "後ろに乗るってことは、しっかり捕まってないと\n危ないよね？　それって……。", "zh": "如果要坐在后座，\n就表示不抓紧会很危险吧？那不就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "a6e658a95af9727da4dd277a52a7fa42c8fad1443351e34f05d0c997615ef4c1", "ja": "い、いや、意識するからヘンなんだよね、うん。\nそうだよ、自然に……。", "zh": "不、不对，就是因为太在意才会觉得怪怪的，嗯。\n没错，自然地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5710dfa05e47106c92d2e9ac865e5b47224f9828f7d353f600d3f2a1a5e0c436", "ja": "おーい、のり子？", "zh": "喂～法子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "afb38462f887a830268cc4580cf46b964e10adc45da3f76a2a4b4da2199b4e25", "ja": "{$P$}、ごめん！\n後ろに乗るの、今日はちょっと待って！", "zh": "{$P$}，抱歉！\n虽然说要让你坐后座，但今天先不要好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0043_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "0a74a06d949ca2cbf8014f4d84a4b1e4aa713117157f2441feaaa6779c4c2e70", "ja": "いや、なんか準備ができてなくって……心の……。\n今度！　今度絶対乗せるから！", "zh": "那个，我还没做好准备……心理层面的……\n下次！下次绝对会载你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
